public/context/corpus.json
  Six articles and 200 questions (with their answers) from the SQuAD v1.1 development set
  (https://rajpurkar.github.io/SQuAD-explorer/), by Pranav Rajpurkar, Jian Zhang, Konstantin
  Lopyrev and Percy Liang, licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Changes are listed in
  public/context/manifest.json. This file is distributed under the same licence.

public/context/emb-*.json, rerank.json, pca.json
  Outputs of sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 and cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L6-v2
  (both Apache License 2.0), run offline by Agent_Loop_Sim's scripts/build_context_data.py; the
  models are not redistributed. public/context/manifest.json records revisions and SHA-256s.

The chapters quote passages of the same SQuAD articles (CC BY-SA 4.0).
